    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosia okorenda Rituko Rinene ri’Epasaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 23:21-23)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Yosia akaba okorenda Rituko Rinene ri‐Epasaka ase Omonene, agwo Yerusalemu, na abanto bakanyenya chimanwa chi’eching’ondi chi’Epasaka ase rituko ria ikomi na kane ri’omotienyi bw’eritang’ani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabeka abakuani ase emeremo yabo na akabaseegeta bakore emeremo y’enyomba y’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agatebereria Abalawi baria barenge aborokia b’Abaisraeli, naende baatananetwe ase Omonene, akabora, “Beka Esanduki eyio enchenu ase enyomba eyio Sulemani, mosinto o Daudi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli, aagachete. Korwa bono timogwenereti koyebogoria igoro ase amareko aino. Bono mokorere Omonene, Nyasae oino, mobakorere na abanto baye Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe ebeke ang’e, kera eamate ase ekeombe kiaye, koreng’ana nomoreberio o Daudi, omorwoti bw’Abaisraeli na oyo o Sulemani, omomura oye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Motenene agwo aase are aachenu buna abateneneri b’ebiombe bie chiamate chi’Abaisraeli bamino batari abakuani. Abalawi babekwe ase kera ekeombe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monyenye ching’ondi chi’Epasaka, naende mwechene abanyene na moroisie ching’ondi echio ase engencho y’abanto bamino, erinde mokore koreng’ana ne ring’ana riri’Omonene akwanete goetera ase Musa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yosia akaa abanto barenge agwo ching’iti chi’ebing’wanso bi’Epasaka. Akarusia korwa ase amaicho aye omonyene chimanwa chi’eching’ondi, na echie chimbori, chilifu emerongo etato (30,000), ne chiombe chilifu isato (3,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagaambi abarenge amo nomorwoti bagancha koa abanto, na abakuani, na Abalawi, ching’iti chi’ebing’wanso. Hilikia na Zakaria, na Yehieli, abateneneri b’enyomba ya Nyasae, bakaa abakuani chimanwa chi’eching’ondi chilifu ibere, na amagana atano na rimo (2,600), ne chiombe amagana atato (300), chibe ebing’wanso bi’Epasaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konania, amo na Semaya na Netaneli, abamura bamwabo, na Hasabia, na Yeieli, na Yosabadi, abanene b’Abalawi, bakaa Abalawi chimanwa chi’eching’ondi, na echie chimbori, chilifu isano (5,000), chibe ebing’wanso bi’Epasaka, ne chiombe amagana atano (500).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero konya okwebeka ang’e gwakorirwe, abakuani bagatenena aase abo, na Abalawi ase ebiombe biabo, koreng’ana buna omorwoti achigete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakanyenya chimanwa chi’eching’ondi chi’Epasaka, erio abakuani bakaegwa amanyinga e chimanwa chiria, bakayanyororokia ekero Abalawi bagendererete korusia amasankwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagaatanana chinyama chie ching’iti chi’ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa ase abanto ba kera eamate, erinde barabwo banyare gochirua ase Omonene, buna ariikire ase Egetabu kia Musa. Naboigo bakorete ne chiombe chiria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagasamba chinyama chie chimanwa chi’Epasaka ase omorero buna achiikire, korende echi’ebing’wanso binde ebichenu bagachiyekera chinyongo, na ebitega, ne chisuguria; erio bwango bagachiirera abanto bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Abalawi bakeroiseria chinyama, boigo bagachiroiseria na abakuani ab’ororeria rwa Aroni, ekiagera abakuani aba nigo barenge nemeremo emenge y’okorua ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa amo nebitinya bi’ebio goika botuko. Naboigo Abalawi beroiseretie chinyama, bakaroiseria nabakuani ab’ororeria rwa Aroni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na abateri, abanto b’eamate y’Asafu, nigo babeerete aase abo buna Daudi, na Asafu, na Hemani, na Yedutuni, omoorori bw’omorwoti, bachigete. Abarendi b’ebiita bakabeera aase abo ase kera egeita. Tibatigete emeremo yabo, ekiagera Abalawi bamwabo mbaabaroiseretie ebing’wanso biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo aya onsi ay’okomokorera Omonene nigo akoretwe ase rituko riria; nigo barendete Epasaka bakarua okoruegwa kw’ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa ase egesasiimero ki’Omonene, buna Yosia omorwoti achigete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli abarenge aroro bakarenda Epasaka ase engaki eria, naende bakagenderera korenda Rituko Rinene ri’Emegati etabekiri memera, ase engaki y’amatuko atano na abere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epasaka enga buna eyio konya tiyana korendwa ase egati y’Abaisraeli korwa amatuko a Samweli omobani. Morwoti onde bw’Abaisraeli konya tana korenda Epasaka buna eria Yosia arendete, ere amo nabakuani, na Abalawi, na Abayuda bonsi, na Abaisraeli abarengeo, na abanto ba Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epasaka eyio enene nigo yarendetwe ase omwaka o ikomi, na gatano na gatato, bw’okogamba kwa Yosia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omoerio bw’okogamba kwa Yosia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(2 Abar 23:28-30)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio onsi, ekero Yosia konya aroisirie Hekalu, Neko, omorwoti o Misiri, agatiira kogenda korwana esegi agwo Karikemisi ase orooche rw’Eufarati, na Yosia akagenda korwana nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti o Misiri agatoma abanto ase Yosia, agateeba, “Aye omorwoti bw’Abayuda, inki inche naye tokoborania? Rituko ria reero tindi gocha korwana esegi naye, korende nobogambi nkorwania, inde nesegi naborobwo, na Nyasae ochikiire ngende bwango. Aye tiga koamererania na Nyasae, oria ore amo nainche, nabaise kogoita.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Yosia tanchete koonchoka korwa ase Neko. Agekona ase ogwetuba ng’a tamanyekana, akagenda korwana na Neko agwo ase ense omweya ya Megido, taigwete amang’ana aye ayaruete ase Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarwani baria bakabwata amata, bakarasa Yosia omorwoti. Erio omorwoti oria agateebia abasomba baye, “Indusie aiga, ekiagera nabetirwe bobe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasomba baye bakamobeka ase egari yaye ende, bakamoira Yerusalemu. Agakwera aroro, na agatindekwa ase chimbeera chie chisokoro chiaye. Abayuda na abanto ba Yerusalemu bonsi bakaba bakomoreera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia akaroisia ogoteera kw’amagombo igoro ya Yosia, na abateri bonsi, abasacha na abakungu, babeire bagwatora Yosia ase amatera abo ay’amagombo nonya ngoika reero iga. Ayio akaba engencho Abaisraeli benaretie. Ogoteera okwo nigo korikire ase Egetabu ki’Amatera ’Amagombo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono amang’ana ande onsi ay’ogokora kwa Yosia, na amaya aya akorete koreng’ana naya ariikire ase amachiiko ’Omonene,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na ogokora kwaye kw’eritang’ani goika okw’omoerio nigo korikire ase Egetabu ki’ogokora kw’Abarwoti b’Abaisraeli na ab’Abayuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
